  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice red onion (see ingredients).\n• In a small bowl, combine the vinegar and a good pinch of sugar and salt.\n• Scrunch sliced onion in your hands, then add to the pickling liquid. Add just enough water to cover onion. Set aside. TIP: If you don't like pickled onion, you can cook the onion in step 4 with the chicken!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62fb14d6f1fd7c03f705a50d/step-9ab34dae.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Grate carrot. Thinly slice cucumber into sticks. Thinly slice long chilli (if using). Slice lemon into wedges.\n• In a medium bowl, combine carrot, mixed salad leaves, chilli and a squeeze of lemon juice. Season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat, then set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62fb14d6f1fd7c03f705a50d/step-ef15aaa4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic. Cut tofu into 2cm chunks.\n• In a small bowl, combine the soy sauce, the honey and garlic. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62fb14d6f1fd7c03f705a50d/step-7d754635.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In the frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook tofu, tossing, until browned and warmed through, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add honey-soy mixture, then remove pan from heat, tossing tofu to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62fb14d6f1fd7c03f705a50d/step-3e0adfcc.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.\n• Meanwhile, combine garlic aioli and a generous squeeze of lemon juice in a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62fb14d6f1fd7c03f705a50d/step-d0b78996.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain pickled onion.\n• Spread some lemon aioli over each tortilla, then top with veggies, Korean-style tofu, cucumber and pickled onion.\n• Sprinkle with crispy shallots and drizzle with remaining lemon aioli.\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62fb14d6f1fd7c03f705a50d/step-d6092b10.jpg"
    }
  ]
